# Sessions and builds

- Never run `tools/assemble-rootfs.sh` while a session is up — `tools/webos-session.sh --down` first.
- `tools/ci.sh` builds `git archive HEAD` (not the dirty tree); do not switch branches mid-CI.
- Node is pinned in `tools/node-version`; use `tools/fetch-node.sh`, not a random system node.
- Reference images of HP live under `/mnt/games/webos-reference` — **do not delete them**.

## Before calling a ticket done

1. Mutation-verify new tests.
2. Code + architecture self-review (or agents) **before** opening the PR.
3. Ask the user for manual UI checks when gestures/focus/launcher placement matter.

## Scope

Stay on the ticket. Open follow-ups as issues; do not expand the PR into #68-style engine work unless asked.
